{"ref":"BDB, יְפִי²","hw":"יְפִי²","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">יְפִי</span>]</big>  <strong>n.m. beauty</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">יֹ֫פִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 3:24\" href=\"/Isaiah.3.24\">Is 3:24</a> + 5 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְפִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 28:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.28.7\">Ez 28:7</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יָפְיִ֑ךָ</span> v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 28:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.28.17\">17</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יָפְיֵךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 45:12\" href=\"/Psalms.45.12\">ψ 45:12</a> + 5 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">יָפְיוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.17\">Is 33:17</a> + 2 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">יָפְיָהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:25\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.25\">Pr 6:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Esther 1:11\" href=\"/Esther.1.11\">Est 1:11</a>; <em>beauty</em> of a woman <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 3:24\" href=\"/Isaiah.3.24\">Is 3:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 45:12\" href=\"/Psalms.45.12\">ψ 45:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Esther 1:11\" href=\"/Esther.1.11\">Est 1:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:25\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.25\">Pr 6:25</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 31:30\" href=\"/Proverbs.31.30\">Pr 31:30</a>; of Jerus. under fig. of woman <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.14\">Ez 16:14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:15\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.15\">15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:25\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.25\">25</a>; Tyre <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.3\">27:3</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(כְּלִילַת יֹ֑פִי)</span>, cf. v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.4\">4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.11\">11</a>; prince of Tyre, <em>beauty</em> of (his) wisdom <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 28:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.28.7\">28:7</a>; king of Tyre v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.12\">12</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(כְּלִיל יפי)</span>, v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.17\">17</a>; ideal beauty of king of Judah <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.17\">Is 33:17</a>, Zion <span dir=\"rtl\">(מִכְלַל־יֹ֑פִי)</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 50:2\" href=\"/Psalms.50.2\">ψ 50:2</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:15\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.15\">La 2:15</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(כְּלִי֫לַת יֹ֑פִי)</span>; of Egypt under fig. of tree <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.8\">Ez 31:8</a>; of ransomed people of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 9:17\" href=\"/Zechariah.9.17\">Zc 9:17</a>.","next":"BDB, יָפוֹ","prev":"BDB, יְפִי"}